msgid "1 lancer par bataille : zone, dégâts et feu."
msgstr "1 throw per battle: area, damage and fire."

msgid "2 lancers par bataille : immobilise une cible."
msgstr "2 throws per battle: immobilizes a target."

msgid "2 tirs empoisonnés par bataille (arc ou arbalète) : la cible touchée s'affaiblit chaque tour."
msgstr "2 poisoned shots per battle (bow or crossbow): the target is weakened each turn."

msgid "3 lancers par bataille : étourdissent."
msgstr "3 throws per battle: stun."

msgid "35 % de chances de viser la tête au lieu de 25 %."
msgstr "35 % chance to aim at the head instead of 25 %."

msgid "A tenu la palissade de son village trois étés de suite, jusqu'au jour où le seigneur a repris ses lances sans payer la dernière solde."
msgstr "Held his village's palisade three summers in a row, until the day the lord took back his spears without paying the last wages."

msgid "Abattre %d ennemis"
msgstr "Slay %d enemies"

msgid "Abattre le Corbeau Noir"
msgstr "Slay the Black Raven"

msgid "Accepter le don de l'Abbaye"
msgstr "Accept the Abbey's gift"

msgid "Accepter le marché de Gaspard (contrat spécial)"
msgstr "Accept Gaspard's deal (special contract)"

msgid "Accepter les provisions qu'elle offre"
msgstr "Accept the provisions she offers"

msgid "Accompli"
msgstr "Accomplished"

msgid "Acheter des onguents (45 couronnes) : +14 PV à tous"
msgstr "Buy ointments (45 crowns): +14 HP to all"

msgid "Acheter des provisions (35 couronnes) : +10 PV à tous, +12 rations"
msgstr "Buy provisions (35 crowns): +10 HP to all, +12 rations"

msgid "Acheter du fil de fer et des rivets (60 couronnes) : armures réparées"
msgstr "Buy wire and rivets (60 crowns): armor repaired"

msgid "Acheter le silence du sergent (120 couronnes)"
msgstr "Buy the sergeant's silence (120 crowns)"

msgid "Acheter ses vivres sans discuter (35 couronnes)"
msgstr "Buy his provisions without haggling (35 crowns)"

msgid "Actif : vous tenez ici un équipement de cette famille."
msgstr "Active: you hold equipment of this family here."

msgid "Aelis la Rousse"
msgstr "Aelis the Red"

msgid "Aider à creuser une fosse"
msgstr "Help dig a pit"

msgid "Aldric boude, mais Aelis a déjà bouclé son sac."
msgstr "Aldric sulks, but Aelis has already packed her bag."

msgid "Aldric la Rousse"
msgstr "Aldric the Red"

msgid "Aldric marche à la traîne, tête basse. Il n'a pas encore quitté son village du regard. « Capitaine, je ne sais pas si je serai assez bon... »"
msgstr "Aldric trails behind, head down. He has not yet taken his eyes off his village. \"Captain, I don't know if I'll be good enough...\""

msgid "Aldric serre les dents et suit. Il se fera ses amis plus tard."
msgstr "Aldric grits his teeth and follows. He will make his friends later."

msgid "Aller parler au bailli (1 jour)"
msgstr "Go and speak to the bailiff (1 day)"

msgid "Allonge : frappe à 2 cases, +10 % au toucher. Deux mains."
msgstr "Reach: strikes at 2 tiles, +10 % to hit. Two hands."

msgid "Allonge : frappe à 2 cases. Deux mains."
msgstr "Reach: strikes at 2 tiles. Two hands."

msgid "Allumer de grands feux et veiller"
msgstr "Light great fires and keep watch"

msgid "Ambre du nord"
msgstr "Northern amber"

msgid "Ancien cavalier d'une compagnie dissoute, il a gardé la cotte de mailles, un orgueil intact et des dettes de jeu."
msgstr "A former rider of a disbanded company, he kept his mail coat, an intact pride and gambling debts."

msgid "Ancien milicien"
msgstr "Former militiaman"

msgid "Ancien sergent d'une levée oubliée, il sait tenir une ligne et compter les hommes qui n'y reviennent pas."
msgstr "A former sergeant of a forgotten levy, he knows how to hold a line and count the men who don't come back to it."

