msgstr "Around the fire, an old refrain goes around the troop. Two men end the night drinking together."

msgid "Autrefois colporteur, ruiné par des voleurs de grand chemin, il a gardé la rancune et perdu le reste."
msgstr "Once a peddler, ruined by highwaymen, he kept the grudge and lost the rest."

